                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "To recommend or not to recommend...\n\nThis short adventure was created by a single person and is their first release. As such, it's no Return to Zork. Yet it has a low price and the developer is active and has responded to feedback with updates and edits. So should yo buy the game?\n\nYes, if you:\n* like classic adventure games\n* want a quick game that isn't too difficult\n* want to support a new developer who is making a genuine effort\n\nNo, if you:\n* hate short games\n* expect perfection\n* don't like classic adventure interfaces\n\nThe game can be completed in half an hour, and while there is nothing spectacular about the story, music, or artwork, it's still pretty impressive for just one guy. I've seen worse games from full studios. This llama approves.",
